  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy of Culinary Arts-vocational training 15-18 - Vocational education culinary</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulinarisk akademi - yrkesh&#xf6;gskola 15-18</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased access to productive employment for young men and women, especially in the hospitality sector.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att etablera en yrkesh&#xf6;gskola av internationell standard f&#xf6;r bes&#xf6;ksindustrin. Etableringen sker i form av ett publikt-offentligt partnerskap, representerad av den kambodjanska staten i form av ministerierna f&#xf6;r arbetsmarknad, turism, handel och utbildning samt det privata n&#xe4;ringslivet. Fr&#xe5;n givarsidan samfinansieras insatsen av Sida och UNOPS/EIF-ES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention supports the creation of a vocational institute of international standard for the hospitality sector. The institute is established in the form of a public-private-partnership, represented by the Cambodian Government in the form of the ministries of labour, tourism, commerce and education and private enterprises.</narrative>
  </description>
